{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN0DG1NY9WAG1QXXP3TWHTQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は自分の最近について書き連ねました。\n脈略がなさすぎて、読みづらいと思います(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近よく聞いている歌は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Adeleさんのhello -cover by TAKAさん-と\nThe Chainsmokersさんのcloserです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しんみり浸りたい気分にはぴったりすぎるくらい\nぴったりです( ◜︎◡︎◝︎ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファミリーマートさんで流れている\n“ファミラジ”から聞き馴染みのある声が聞こえてくるのが毎回不思議で\nすごく感動して\nやっぱり不思議な気持ちになります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂がファミラジを担当させていただいてるなんてありがたすぎます。未だに信じられません、、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本屋さんで何もせずに、\n本の背表紙を見てる時間が1番好きだなーと最近気付きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「暮しの手帖」が売ってあって、\nとと姉ちゃんガチ勢の私には見逃せませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど1冊2000円だったので購入は断念しました\n無性に読んでみたいが、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この世で1番落ち着く場所は図書館です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ことばの同義語を調べることが好きです。\n新しく知る言葉がいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログの最初の\n“書き連ねました”のひとことも\n自分の気持ちに1番しっくりくる言葉を調べたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"羅列、列記、列挙、挙げる、枚挙、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ出てきました。日本語って面白いな〜(´｡･_･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと気楽に生きたらハッピーになれそう(  ˘-˘  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど深く分析しすぎる自分のその性格はわりと好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生、お刺身を食べて暮らせたらいいのにー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN0DH4SX5H2437T49150QT2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN0DJ8S01H3HHEZNXQT3GH1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログお読みいただきありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長濱ねる"}],"source":"archive"}